Z||000000||skitime||08-06-2001||08:00 PM||||Hey all, since Williamsburg is over Veronica V6GT and I are going on vacation through New England, New Brunswick and Nova Scotia from Pennsylvania.  We will be traveling about three weeks. We would love to meet other Pennocks people on the trip. (As well as their cars) We are traveling in our motorhome(Lots of room for Fiero parts).  We have no schedule of where and when we will be anywhere. (The only way to travel)  If you would like a visit e-mail me your name,address and phone number and we will try to get in touch with you if we are in your area. (If you see this thread later still e-mail me and I will have my daughter give me the information via phone.) Hope to see you on the road!   <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG">   <P><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 08-06-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||Denny||08-06-2001||08:35 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><BR>So you definitely won't make the Fiero Dutch Classic II, huh?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||skitime||08-06-2001||08:45 PM||||Sorry no we won't be unless some drastically changes.  I was thinking of having my daughter show my car but probably not.  VeronicaV6GT needs a vacation and I haven't been there in many years.  Being a teacher I have been on vacation for two months already. hehe  We will be scouring the countryside and probably a few junkyards too for Fieros. Gee, maybe I should take the flatbed trailer along just in case.<p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 08-06-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||Elvira||08-06-2001||09:52 PM||||Hey Skitime,<BR>  Chester and I live in NH on the Mass border off of 95.  We are normally here unless you are talking the last weekend of this month.  At that time we will be on our way to Milwaukee to pick up the 4 seater to bring here to New England.  Can't wait!  If you are going to passing this way, send us an email at chester@ttlc.net and maybe we can all get together.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR><P>------------------<BR>Elvira<BR>Blue 87GT<BR>Black 86GT 5sp x 2<BR>86SC t-top 58k miles||||reg||10
