Z||000009||skitime||08-07-2001||11:05 AM||||Well we are all packed up and ready to go.  Please email me at skitime@ptd.net if you would like to meet.  I will be calling my daughter for names, addresses and phone numbers from the emails of Pennocks people along our route.  It would be great to meet some of you.  <P>Elvira - we might be there today or in the morning.  Check your email for our phone number.<P>jelly2m8 - We are really going to try to make it to your town.  We will be in touch closer to the time of arrival.<P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>Red 88 GT T-TOP<BR><LI>Red 86 GT<BR></UL> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/signature-1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
