Z||000021||87V6GT||08-10-2001||07:14 PM||||If you are in NH, you can swing over to Plainfield (near Lebanon and Hanover NH) and visit us. The Kelley family (with our ever growing family of Fieros) is always happy in meeting other Fiero lovers. My son Steve and his family are always looking to meet other Fiero owners. We would love to get some photos too. We are good friends with Elvira and her family in Newmarket. This next weekend is the Lebanon NH show that has a Fiero class. It would be neat if you could go to that?<BR>Either way, let us know.<P>Russ Kelley<BR>87 GT (maroon)<BR>87 GT (blue)<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Merrimack-RussKelley3rd.jpg"> ||||reg||7
