Z||000043||skitime||08-18-2001||11:10 PM||||Hey Jimmybpei, Its good to here from you.  I am glad to see you are on the forum too. This place almost gets to be like family. We were at our clubs Fiero show today and I was telling several people about your awesome work your yellow notchback. We also kept talking about your Indy, we are trying to figure out where we could store it.  I was hoping that Jelly2m8 would get first dibs on some parts I know he needs but the yard is in Parrsboro.  Call him and maybe you both can work out a deal with the guy.  I will email you his phone number because you both should get acquainted anyway since there are so few Fiero enthusiast up there. ||||reg||1
